#### Generalization of the formula to all nuclei far from stability

In previous section, it is demonstrated that the new formula (Eq. (2.13)) works very well for describing the first and second forbidden \(\beta^{+}\)-decays of the nuclei far from stability near the \(Z=82\) closed shell. Now we generalize this formula to include the allowed \(\beta^{+}\)-transition and to include all available experimental data of nuclei far from

