### \(\phi\to K^{+}K^{-}\) reconstruction

TPC is the main detector in STAR for tracking and identifying charged particles as discussed in section 4.2.2. To reconstruct \(\phi\) with good mass resolution and signal to background ratio from its \(K^{+}K^{-}\) decay channel, both excellent tracking and kaon identification are needed.

