\(p_{T}\) shower partons, then we would expect the nuclear modification factor of \(\phi\) meson to be close to those of \(\pi^{-}\) and \(K^{-}\), and smaller than those of \(\overline{p}\) and \(\overline{\Lambda}\). In this section, we test the two different kinds of theoretical models by \(\phi\) meson measurements in \(d\)+Au 200 GeV collisions at STAR.

